flowchart TB
    %% LoadedConfig keeps the two layers apart
    file[(config.yaml)] --> loaded
    env[CRYSTALLINE_* variables] --> parse[EnvOverlay: parse once at startup]
    parse --> check{Known variable?}
    check -->|no| warn[Warn and ignore]
    check -->|yes, bad value| fatal[Refuse to start, name the variable]
    check -->|yes| loaded
    subgraph loaded [LoadedConfig]
        direction LR
        persisted[file: what writes go to]
        effective[effective: file plus overlay]
    end
    effective --> reads[Every runtime read]
    persisted --> writes[config set]
